{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8xOTk5LS1CZWZvcmUvTWlnaHR5JTIwSm9lJTIwWW91bmclMjAlMjgxOTk4JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Mighty Joe Young","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/jM39MOyLOxCD6Njz4vfQkGaKkY1.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dkNjhkEk2tw7hoxx7Ik1YQsdenZ.jpg","description":"As a child living in Africa, Jill Young saw her mother killed while protecting wild gorillas from poachers led by Andrei Strasser. Now an adult, Jill cares for an orphaned gorilla named Joe -- who, due to a genetic anomaly, is 15 feet tall. When Gregg O'Hara arrives from California and sees the animal, he convinces Jill that Joe would be safest at his wildlife refuge. But Strasser follows them to the U.S., intent on capturing Joe for himself.","releaseInfo":"1998","genres":["Adventure","Family","Action","Fantasy","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.3","runtime":"114 min","cast":["Charlize Theron","Bill Paxton","Rade Šerbedžija","Peter Firth","David Paymer","Regina King","Robert Wisdom","Naveen Andrews"],"director":["Ron Underwood"],"released":"1998-12-25T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Survival is an instinct.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Charlize Theron","character":"Jill Young","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gd7ShD0yt4bsR2STeQ19KQ6hvXL.jpg"},{"name":"Bill Paxton","character":"Gregg O'Hara","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aLdNe6mt1cSi2zWlUYRregzfis5.jpg"},{"name":"Rade Šerbedžija","character":"Strasser","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1mJC5oD3pLH1vAS3wJ4sGNxYeqJ.jpg"},{"name":"Peter Firth","character":"Garth","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/o7zbRKlhY8v9mhxyBvAwou7l200.jpg"},{"name":"David Paymer","character":"Harry Ruben","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/owoOdDFgXpls1OFKwmQ104Nkl5.jpg"},{"name":"Regina King","character":"Cecily Banks","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fEIz0ljk9CBrp3AitM5nwjfoGVu.jpg"},{"name":"Robert Wisdom","character":"Kweli","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org